<title>USA: Todd Shipyard 10.24 pct stake held by Weil.</title>
<headline>Todd Shipyard 10.24 pct stake held by Weil.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Louis investor John Weil said Monday he held a 10.24 percent stake in Todd Shipyards Corp, or 1,016,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Weil said he bought 23,900 common shares between August 1 and August 20 at net prices ranging from $6.375 to $6,625 each.</p>
<p>Weil is one of the nominees for the board of directors scheduled to be elected at the 1996 annual stockholder meeting, the filing said.</p>
</text>
